Subject: [PATCH] Port the original four-format water copyback to fxceless
 0b0074e

Adapt Geckomacabre/vx-layer eee5667d7119bc4a378214621e1b18a814ebe80f to the 0b0074e command-list hooks. The readback implementation is byte-for-byte identical to the original.

Verified on an RTX 5070 Ti in Series X mode through the Gone Fishing boat handoff.
